msgid "The expected audience `aud` claim value, which can be a string or an array of strings. Note the audience claim is verified for ID tokens by default. ID token audience must be equal to the value of `quarkus.oidc.client-id` property. Use this property to override the expected value if your OpenID Connect provider sets a different audience claim value in ID tokens. Set it to `any` if your provider does not set ID token audience` claim. Audience verification for access tokens is only done if this property is configured."
